00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:07.273 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Tucker: GOOD EVENING.

00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:07.774 line:78%
WELCOME TO "TUCKER CARLSON

00:00:07.507 --> 00:00:08.641 line:78%
TONIGHT."

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:10.310 line:78%
WHAT EXACTLY HAPPENED IN

00:00:08.742 --> 00:00:11.578 line:78%
YESTERDAY'S MIDTERM ELECTIONS?

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.345 line:78%
WISH WE COULD TELL YOU WITH SOME

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:13.847 line:78%
PRECISION.

00:00:12.445 --> 00:00:15.515 line:78%
THAT'S OUR JOB, BUT WE CAN'T,

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:16.616 line:78%
BECAUSE IN A NUMBER OF KEY RACES

00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:17.851 line:78%
AROUND THE COUNTRY WE STILL

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:19.452 line:78%
DON'T HAVE A VOTE TOTAL.

00:00:18.018 --> 00:00:20.687 line:78%
IN ARIZONA, FOR EXAMPLE, THERE'S

00:00:19.552 --> 00:00:22.055 line:78%
NO DECLARED WINNER IN THE SENATE

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:25.158 line:78%
RACE OR GOVERNOR'S RACE.

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:27.794 line:78%
AT THIS POINT IT SEEMS LIKE BOTH

00:00:25.258 --> 00:00:28.161 line:78%
KARI LAKE AND BLAKE MASTERS WILL

00:00:27.894 --> 00:00:31.898 line:78%
WIN.

00:00:28.328 --> 00:00:32.565 line:78%
WE'LL SPEAK TO KARI LAKE IN JUST

00:00:31.998 --> 00:00:34.634 line:78%
A MINUTE.

00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:35.902 line:78%
THE OFFICIAL RESULTS MAY NOT BE

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:38.304 line:78%
