00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.305 line:78%
A MONTH.

00:00:38.405 --> 00:00:41.441 line:78%
OFFICIALS SAID THEY ARE PREPARED

00:00:39.406 --> 00:00:43.243 line:78%
TO WORK THROUGH THANKSGIVING AND

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:44.677 line:78%
POSSIBLY CHRISTMAS AS WELL.

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:46.880 line:78%
THAT MEANS RESULTS BY NEW YEAR'S

00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:48.982 line:78%
IN A RACE THAT WAS HELD IN EARLY

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:51.718 line:78%
NOVEMBER.

00:00:49.082 --> 00:00:53.953 line:78%
THAT SEEMS LATE HOW LATE IS IT?

00:00:51.918 --> 00:00:55.755 line:78%
BY COMPARISON, THE RESULTS OF

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:57.057 line:78%
THE 1862 MIDTERM ELECTRICS,

00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:57.857 line:78%
TABULATED BY CANDLELIGHT,

00:00:57.157 --> 00:01:00.260 line:78%
WITHOUT MACHINES OR ELECTRICITY,

00:00:57.957 --> 00:01:01.528 line:78%
IN THE MIDDLE OF A RAGING CIVIL

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:01.961 line:78%
WAR, WERE CLEAR BEFORE THE END

00:01:01.661 --> 00:01:06.933 line:78%
OF THE WEEK.

00:01:02.062 --> 00:01:09.569 line:78%
THAT WAS THE ENTIRE COUNTRY.

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:10.970 line:78%
ARIZONA IS A SINGLE STATE, A

00:01:09.669 --> 00:01:13.807 line:78%
FRACTION OF THE STATE OF

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:15.809 line:78%
FLORIDA, WHICH TALLIED ITS VOTES

00:01:14.007 --> 00:01:17.944 line:78%
IN AN ENTIRE DAY.

00:01:16.376 --> 00:01:19.879 line:78%
COUNTING THE VOTES ISN'T AN

00:01:18.044 --> 00:01:20.280 line:78%
ADDED EXTRA YOU GET FOR

00:01:19.979 --> 00:01:21.915 line:78%
GOVERNMENT.

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:23.716 line:78%
THEY HAVE A SURPLUS, LIKE

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:25.218 line:78%
FIGHTING CLIMATE CHANGE,

00:01:23.817 --> 00:01:27.220 line:78%
COUNTING THE VOTES IS A CORE

00:01:25.485 --> 00:01:29.222 line:78%
FUNCTION OF GOVERNMENT, ALONG

00:01:27.687 --> 00:01:30.523 line:78%
WITH LAW ENFORCEMENT, KEEPING

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:31.424 line:78%
THE BORDER SECURE.

00:01:30.623 --> 00:01:33.660 line:78%
EFFICIENT ELECTIONS ARE THE

00:01:31.524 --> 00:01:35.161 line:78%
REASONS YOU PAY TAXES.

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:35.528 line:78%
ARIZONA DOESN'T SEEM TO HAVE

00:01:35.261 --> 00:01:37.263 line:78%
THEM.

00:01:35.862 --> 00:01:40.567 line:78%
WHY IS THAT?

00:01:37.363 --> 00:01:42.802 line:78%
DON'T ASK.

00:01:40.967 --> 00:01:43.536 line:78%
NO UNAUTHORIZED QUESTIONS.

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:46.706 line:78%
INSTEAD WATCH COUNTRY.

00:01:43.636 --> 00:01:47.807 line:78%
OR IF YOU DON'T HAVE CABLE,

00:01:46.806 --> 00:01:48.174 line:78%
SIMPLY TRUST YOUR LOCAL

00:01:47.907 --> 00:01:49.976 line:78%
OFFICIALS.

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:51.144 line:78%
&gt;&gt; THAT'S THE WONDER OF

00:01:50.076 --> 00:01:52.378 line:78%
DEMOCRACY, WHETHER YOU'RE A

00:01:51.244 --> 00:01:53.980 line:78%
DEMOCRAT OR REPUBLICAN, AND I

00:01:52.479 --> 00:01:56.316 line:78%
WANTED TO POINT THAT OUT TO BE

00:01:54.114 --> 00:01:56.716 line:78%
THE CRANK IN THE ROOM, FOLLOWING

00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:57.817 line:78%
BRIANNA.

00:01:56.816 --> 00:01:59.586 line:78%
STAY OFF SOCIAL MEDIA, PEOPLE.

00:01:57.951 --> 00:02:00.954 line:78%
IF YOU'RE TRYING TO FIGURE OUT

00:01:59.686 --> 00:02:02.822 line:78%
IF THERE ARE REALLY ISSUES WITH

00:02:01.054 --> 00:02:04.023 line:78%
VOTING, TRUST YOUR LOCAL

00:02:02.922 --> 00:02:05.692 line:78%
OFFICIALS, TRUST US HERE, A NEWS

00:02:04.124 --> 00:02:07.560 line:78%
SOURCE THAT YOU KNOWS, AND

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:12.365 line:78%
THEY'RE DOING THEIR JOBS AND

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:13.600 line:78%
DOING IT RIGHT.

