&gt;&gt; Tucker: "THEY'RE DOING THEIR

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:18.738 line:78%
JOBS.

00:02:14.134 --> 00:02:20.140 line:78%
THEY'RE DOING IT RIGHT."

00:02:18.838 --> 00:02:20.807 line:78%
HA-HA-HA!

