REALLY?

00:02:20.907 --> 00:02:24.677 line:78%
THE STATE OF OUR ELECTIONS IS

00:02:22.976 --> 00:02:26.379 line:78%
EMBARRASSING, BUT SO WERE LAST

00:02:24.777 --> 00:02:27.046 line:78%
NIGHT'S ELECTIONS.

00:02:26.479 --> 00:02:28.948 line:78%
REPUBLICANS SWORE THEY WERE

00:02:27.147 --> 00:02:30.383 line:78%
GOING TO SWEEP, A RED TSUNAMI.

