THAT'S WHAT THEY TOLD US, AND

00:02:30.483 --> 00:02:32.619 line:78%
WE, TO BE HONEST, CAUTIOUSLY

00:02:31.818 --> 00:02:34.020 line:78%
BELIEVED THEM.

00:02:32.719 --> 00:02:36.055 line:78%
THEY DID NOT SWEEP, NOT EVEN

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:37.857 line:78%
CLOSE TO WEEPING.

00:02:36.289 --> 00:02:39.125 line:78%
THE REPUBLICAN PARTY MAY TAKE

00:02:37.957 --> 00:02:41.261 line:78%
