00:02:43.763 --> 00:02:47.834 line:78%
THE PLAN WAS SIMPLE.

00:02:45.431 --> 00:02:49.402 line:78%
IT SEEMED EASY A WEEK AGO.

00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:51.604 line:78%
AN UNPOPULAR PRESIDENT, A

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:53.973 line:78%
FALTERING ECONOMY, AN OPEN

00:02:51.704 --> 00:02:56.409 line:78%
BORDER, THE LOOMING RISK OF

00:02:54.073 --> 00:02:57.877 line:78%
NUCLEAR WAR, HOW ABOUT THAT, PUT

