PRETTY FRUSTRATING.

00:03:11.224 --> 00:03:15.828 line:78%
YOU WANT REPUBLICANS TO WIN, NOT

00:03:12.692 --> 00:03:22.135 line:78%
BECAUSE THEY'RE SO GREAT, BUT

