.ONE OFFENSE PEOPLE WHOSE JOB IT

00:03:22.268 --> 00:03:26.439 line:78%
WAS TO WIN AND DID NOT WIN

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:27.440 line:78%
SHOULD GO DO SOMETHING ELSE NOW,

00:03:26.539 --> 00:03:30.877 line:78%
WE'RE SPEAKING SPECIFICALLY OF

00:03:29.309 --> 00:03:32.178 line:78%
THE REPUBLICAN LEADERSHIP OF THE

00:03:30.977 --> 00:03:33.846 line:78%
HOUSE AND SENATE.

