THAT HAD NOTHING TO DO WITH

00:04:59.299 --> 00:05:01.834 line:78%
TRUMP, IN MICHIGAN, FOR EXAMPLE.

00:05:00.833 --> 00:05:03.569 line:78%
WHETHER YOU LIKE TRUMP OR NOT,

00:05:01.934 --> 00:05:04.437 line:78%
AND MANY DON'T, AND A LOT DO,

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:04.937 line:78%
IT'S MORE COMPLICATED THAN JUST

00:05:04.537 --> 00:05:07.440 line:78%
HIM.

00:05:05.038 --> 00:05:11.611 line:78%
THEN THERE'S THE MOST AMUSINGLY

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:11.978 line:78%
STUPID EXPLANATION OF ALL.

00:05:11.711 --> 00:05:12.545 line:78%
[COUGHING]

00:05:12.078 --> 00:05:14.514 line:78%
EXCUSE US.

00:05:12.645 --> 00:05:15.648 line:78%
ALL THIS ELECTION TALK.

00:05:14.614 --> 00:05:16.883 line:78%
SO BAD CANDIDATES WERE THE

00:05:15.748 --> 00:05:18.318 line:78%
PROBLEM.

00:05:16.983 --> 00:05:22.188 line:78%
THAT'S ALL OVER TWITTER.

00:05:19.085 --> 00:05:23.690 line:78%
