00:05:29.462 --> 00:05:30.096 line:78%
MATTER?

00:05:29.829 --> 00:05:31.364 line:78%
LET'S SEE.

00:05:30.196 --> 00:05:33.633 line:78%
JOE BIDEN GOT ELECTED PRESIDENT

00:05:31.831 --> 00:05:36.469 line:78%
TWO YEARS AGO FROM THE BASEMENT.

00:05:34.967 --> 00:05:37.670 line:78%
JOHN FETTERMAN BECAME A U.S.

00:05:36.569 --> 00:05:38.738 line:78%
SENATOR LAST NIGHT.

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:39.739 line:78%
DOES ANYBODY THINK JOHN

00:05:38.838 --> 00:05:40.840 line:78%
