AND THEY VOTED FOR JOHN

00:05:59.559 --> 00:06:00.393 line:78%
FETTERMAN.

00:05:59.926 --> 00:06:01.761 line:78%
HE WON ANYWAY.

00:06:00.493 --> 00:06:03.563 line:78%
WHAT DOES THAT TELL YOU?

00:06:01.861 --> 00:06:04.764 line:78%
IT TELLS YOU IN SOME CASES

00:06:03.663 --> 00:06:05.732 line:78%
CANDIDATE QUALITY IS NOT THE

00:06:04.864 --> 00:06:07.033 line:78%
MOST IMPORTANT THING.

00:06:05.832 --> 00:06:08.601 line:78%
WHAT IS?

00:06:07.133 --> 00:06:08.968 line:78%
WELL, THE MECHANICS OF AN

00:06:08.701 --> 00:06:09.369 line:78%
ELECTION.

00:06:09.068 --> 00:06:11.337 line:78%
THEY MATTER.

00:06:09.469 --> 00:06:12.472 line:78%
IN THAT CASE, THEY MATTER

00:06:11.504 --> 00:06:13.306 line:78%
SOMETIMES THAN ANY OTHER

00:06:12.572 --> 00:06:13.673 line:78%
INDIVIDUAL RUNNING IN THE

00:06:13.406 --> 00:06:15.108 line:78%
ELECTION.

