SO OFTEN, REPUBLICANS CAN

00:06:32.592 --> 00:06:36.195 line:78%
COMMUNICATE THEIR MESSAGE

00:06:34.527 --> 00:06:37.830 line:78%
UNENCUMBERED ON A SINGLE CABLE

00:06:36.295 --> 00:06:38.197 line:78%
TELEVISION AND LOW-TRAFFICKED

00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:38.664 line:78%
WEBSITES.

