IT'S A CAMPAIGN APPARATUS, AND

00:06:45.772 --> 00:06:49.375 line:78%
ONLY THE DEMOCRATS HAVE IT.

00:06:47.774 --> 00:06:51.744 line:78%
YOU CAN WHINE ABOUT THAT.

00:06:49.475 --> 00:06:54.380 line:78%
"OOH, THE MEDIA ARE LIBERAL."

00:06:52.178 --> 00:06:54.947 line:78%
IT'S NOT ABOUT LIBERAL OR

00:06:54.614 --> 00:06:56.816 line:78%
CONSERVATIVE.

00:06:55.047 --> 00:06:57.617 line:78%
IT'S ABOUT WINNING ELECTIONS.

00:06:56.916 --> 00:06:58.217 line:78%
DEMOCRATS CAN WIN BECAUSE THEY

